{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q194406","formula":"C₂₁H₂₂N₂O₂","hill":"C21H22N2O2","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":21.0,"H":22.0,"N":2.0,"O":2.0},"names":{"en":"Strychnine","ru":"Стрихнин","uk":"Стрихнін"},"descriptions":{"en":"Strychnine (, STRIK-neen, -⁠nin, US chiefly -⁠nyne) is a highly toxic, colorless, bitter, crystalline alkaloid used as a pesticide, particularly for killing small vertebrates such as birds and rodents. Strychnine, when inhaled, swallowed, or absorbed through the eyes or mouth, causes poisoning which results in muscular convulsions and eventually death through asphyxia. While it is no longer used medicinally, it was used historically in small doses to strengthen muscle contractions, such as a heart and bowel stimulant and performance-enhancing drug.","ru":"Стрихни́н (лат. Strychninum) — C21H22N2O2 индоловый алкалоид, выделенный в 1818 г. Пеллетье и Кавенту из рвотных орешков — семян чилибухи (Strychnos nux-vomica).","uk":"Стрихні́н — безбарвна, дуже гірка на смак (поріг відчуття — 1 частина стрихніну на 700 000 частин води), кристалічна речовина, за структурною будовою гетероциклічний алкалоїд. Токсин дерева чилібуха. Дуже отруйна."},"fame":55,"pubchemCid":441071,"mass":334.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1CN2CC3=CCO[C@H]4CC(=O)N5[C@H]6[C@H]4[C@H]3C[C@H]2[C@@]61C7=CC=CC=C75","inchikey":"QMGVPVSNSZLJIA-FVWCLLPLSA-N","iupac":"(4aR,5aS,8aR,13aS,15aS,15bR)-4a,5,5a,7,8,13a,15,15a,15b,16-decahydro-2H-4,6-methanoindolo[3,2,1-ij]oxepino[2,3,4-de]pyrrolo[2,3-h]quinolin-14-one","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"441071","atoms":47,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-2.599,"y":2.134,"z":0.455,"el":"O"},{"x":1.941,"y":3.399,"z":0.38,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.421,"y":-2.619,"z":0.375,"el":"N"},{"x":1.121,"y":1.218,"z":0.384,"el":"N"},{"x":0.469,"y